{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">KEYLABEL function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309918","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/KEYLABEL-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/KEYLABEL-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"KEYLABEL-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">KEYLABEL function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Evaluates a key code (such as 301) and returns\na character string that is the predefined keyboard label for that\nkey (such as <strong class=\"ph b keylabel\">F1</strong>).    </p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does not apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"KEYLABEL-function__syntax_GC18SK2695649\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d122946e102\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"KEYLABEL-function__idGDM2K92672093\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>KEYLABEL ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">key-code</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">key-code</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The key code of the key whose label you want to know. A special\ncase of <var class=\"keyword varname\">key-code </var>is LASTKEY. See <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Development:\nProgramming Interfaces</cite> for a list of key codes and key labels.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"KEYLABEL-function__example_GC18SL2695658\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d122946e152\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure reads each keystroke the user makes, leaving the procedure only\nwhen the user presses <strong class=\"ph b keylabel\">GO</strong>. The KEYLABEL\nfunction tests the LASTKEY pressed, and returns the label of the\nkey. (Remember that the value in LASTKEY is the key code of the\nlast key pressed.)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-keylbl.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"KEYLABEL-function__idGDM2KA2672099\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DISPLAY &quot;Press the &quot; + KBLABEL(&quot;GO&quot;) + &quot; key to leave procedure&quot;\n  FORMAT &quot;x(50)&quot;.\nREPEAT:\n  READKEY.\n  HIDE MESSAGE.\n  IF LASTKEY = KEYCODE(KBLABEL(&quot;GO&quot;)) THEN RETURN.\n  MESSAGE &quot;Sorry, you pressed the&quot;  <strong class=\"ph b\">KEYLABEL(LASTKEY)</strong> &quot;key.&quot;.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"KEYLABEL-function__note_GC18SM2695666\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d122946e193\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">Some key\ncodes can be associated with more than one key label. The KEYLABEL\nfunction always returns the label listed first in the ABL table\nof key labels.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"KEYLABEL-function__see-also_GC18SN2695670\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d122946e202\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"KEYCODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/KEYCODE-function.html\">KEYCODE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"KEYFUNCTION-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/KEYFUNCTION-function.html\">KEYFUNCTION function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"KEYFUNCTION-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/KEYFUNCTION-function.html\">KEYFUNCTION function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"KEYWORD-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/KEYWORD-function.html\">KEYWORD function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309918","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"KEYLABEL function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/KEYLABEL-function.html","type":"Manual"}